#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/graded-electrodes.ipynb:245
msgid ""
"We observe that, even though the average porosity is the same for the three "
"cases the discharge capacity is much higher with the graded electrode where "
"porosity is higher near the separator. This is because the higher porosity "
"near the separator facilitates the ion transport and the better utilisation "
"of the active material."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/graded-electrodes.ipynb:247
msgid ""
"As a sanity check we can plot the porosity profiles for the three cases and "
"see they match what we intended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/graded-electrodes.ipynb:-1
msgid "[6]:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/graded-electrodes.ipynb:-1
msgid ""
